"tabpanel\"><img src=\"/homepage/refined-crm/hubspot.webp\" alt=\"HubSpot product-inspired preview\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 16px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgb(17, 17, 20), rgb(17, 17, 20)) padding-box padding-box, linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.8), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 65%, rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.3)) border-box border-box; box-shadow: rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.14) 0px 18px 50px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Conversation history</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\">Linked to the right CRM record</span></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 16px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgb(17, 17, 20), rgb(17, 17, 20)) padding-box padding-box, linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(43, 89, 255, 0.8), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 65%, rgba(43, 89, 255, 0.3)) border-box border-box; box-shadow: rgba(43, 89, 255, 0.14) 0px 18px 50px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Call activity</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\">Shown alongside conversations</span></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 16px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgb(17, 17, 20), rgb(17, 17, 20)) padding-box padding-box, linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.8), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 65%, rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3)) border-box border-box; box-shadow: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.14) 0px 18px 50px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px;\">AI-populated CRM fields</strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\">From what customers said</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"sec v16-s4\" data-v16-sec=\"4\" data-v16-name=\"SecurityB\"><section class=\"dark playing\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; min-height: 0px; background: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 1px, transparent 1px) 0% 0% / 22px 22px rgb(11, 11, 12); overflow: hidden; font-family: Geist, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\n\n<div style=\"max-width: 1280px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 112px 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 40px;\">\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-align: center; animation: 0.8s ease 0s 1 normal both running up-s4;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em;\">Your conversations. <span class=\"shim-d\">Your controls.</span></h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; width: 100%; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\">Reps won’t use a tool that pulls in their personal WhatsApp. With Eazybe, personal and private group chats never sync. Only the business chats you select reach your CRM, and admins decide who sees them. Forward this to your IT or legal team. The certifications are below.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div aria-label=\"Privacy settings mockup (try it)\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 720px; padding: 8px 28px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgb(17, 17, 20), rgb(17, 17, 20)) padding-box padding-box, linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.8), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 65%, rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.3)) border-box border-box; box-shadow: rgba(46, 194, 126, 0.14) 0px 18px 50px; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"sec-card\">\n<div style=\"animation: 0.6s ease 0.35s 1 normal both running up-s4; padding: 22px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(38, 38, 43); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 17px;\">Sync business chats</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\" class=\"sw-desc\">Only the business chats you select</span></div>\n<button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" class=\"sw is-on\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"Sync business chats\" data-sw=\"sync\"><span class=\"sw-k\"></span></button>\n</div>\n<div style=\"animation: 0.6s ease 0.35s 1 normal both running up-s4; padding: 22px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(38, 38, 43); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 17px;\">Personal and private group chats</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\" class=\"sw-desc\">Excluded, never synced</span></div>\n<button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" class=\"sw\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Personal and private group chats\" data-sw=\"private\"><span class=\"sw-k\"></span></button>\n</div>\n<div style=\"animation: 0.6s ease 0.35s 1 normal both running up-s4; padding: 22px 0px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 17px;\">Access controls</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(180, 180, 188);\" class=\"acl-desc\">Business conversations stay under your access controls</span></div>\n<div class=\"acl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"acl-btn\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"v16-acl-menu\"><span class=\"acl-v\">Admin</span><span class=\"acl-c\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><ul class=\"acl-menu\" id=\"v16-acl-menu\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Access level\" hidden=\"\"><li role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-role=\"Admin\" data-desc=\"Sees every synced business chat\"><span>Admin</span><small>Sees every synced business chat</small></li><li role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-role=\"Manager\" data-desc=\"Sees business chats for their team\"><span>Manager</span><small>Sees business chats for their team</small></li><li role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-role=\"Sales rep\" data-desc=\"Sees only their own business chats\"><span>Sales rep</span><small>Sees only their own business chats</small></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"caps\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Compliance\"><span class=\"cap\" role=\"listitem\"><img src=\"/trust-badges/soc2-type2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><b>SOC 2 Type II</b><span>Certified</span></span><span class=\"cap\" role=\"listitem\"><img src=\"/trust-badges/gdpr.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><b>GDPR</b><span>Compliant</span></span><span class=\"cap\" role=\"listitem\"><img src=\"/trust-badges/ccpa.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"41\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><b>CCPA</b><span>Ready</span></span><span class=\"cap\" role=\"listitem\"><img src=\"/trust-badges/pci-dss.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><b>PCI DSS</b><span>Compliant</span></span></div>\n\n</div>\n</section></div>\n<div class=\"sec v16-s5\" data-v16-sec=\"5\" data-v16-name=\"Faq\"><section id=\"faq\" class=\"fq\"><div class=\"fq-in\">\n<div class=\"fq-head\"><span class=\"fq-tag\">Frequently asked questions</span><h2>Know what <span class=\"shim\">connects</span></h2><p>Your questions about conversations, calls and access.</p></div>\n<div class=\"fq-list\" id=\"faq-list\"><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">01</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Who is Eazybe?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Think of Eazybe as the bridge between WhatsApp and your CRM. It’s a WhatsApp CRM integration for teams that sell over chats and calls, giving managers full visibility while AI takes care of replies and follow ups.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">02</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">How does Eazybe sync WhatsApp chats?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Reps keep their own number and phone, and their business chats flow into a shared team inbox and your CRM through WhatsApp CRM sync. Files, voice notes and calls come along too, so the CRM fills itself in while reps get on with selling.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">03</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Which CRMs does Eazybe support?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>You get ready made connections for HubSpot, Salesforce, Zoho CRM, Pipedrive, Odoo, Bitrix24, LeadSquared, Freshworks and Google Sheets. Using something else? The Eazybe API and webhooks let you plug in almost any tool.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">04</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">What is WhatsApp sales intelligence in Eazybe?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Eazybe sales intelligence uses AI to go through your WhatsApp chats and calls, pick out details like budget, urgency and buying intent, and save them as fields in your CRM. Your team can then filter hot leads and get alerts from Eazybe when someone is ready to buy.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">05</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">What does the WhatsApp AI agent do?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>The AI agent answers your leads on WhatsApp when your team can’t. It looks at their past chats and deal details in your CRM, asks what they need and books a call with your rep. When the lead is ready to talk, it passes the chat to the right person on your team.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">06</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Does Eazybe track phone calls?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>It does. Call tracking logs every call’s time, length and outcome in your CRM, working with SIM calls on Android and virtual calls. Reps can run through call lists with bulk dialling, and Voice AI can phone leads on its own, hold a real conversation, book meetings and save the transcript for your team.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">07</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Can Eazybe send automatic follow ups?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes, CRM workflows take care of that. If a quote gets no reply in three days, for example, an automated WhatsApp follow up goes out from the rep’s own number and stops as soon as the customer writes back.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">08</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Is the WhatsApp Business API required?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>No, most of Eazybe works with the number you already have. The WhatsApp Cloud API only comes into play for things like large broadcasts with approved templates, and Eazybe can set it up on your existing number without touching your app or chat history.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">09</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Is my data safe with Eazybe?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Eazybe only syncs the business chats you pick, so personal conversations stay personal, and access controls decide who sees what. When a rep leaves, their chats, files and call history stay with the customer record for the next rep, while they keep their own number.</p></details><details name=\"eazybe-faq\"><summary><span class=\"fq-n\">10</span><h3 class=\"fq-q\">Does Eazybe offer a free trial?</h3><span class=\"fq-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes, there’s a 4 day free trial so you can test Eazybe with your own team, number and CRM. You can also book a demo and have the Eazybe team walk you through it first.</p></details></div>\n</div></section></div>"